# 🔎 CRM Deployment – Integration Audit & Action Plan

This rule inventories what is implemented, what’s missing, and what’s next across major areas: Email/Human Inbox, Farfalle intelligence, Voice (Vapi/Twilio), LeadGen, RBAC/Permissions, and Deployment. It links to concrete files to guide implementation.

## 1) Email System & Human Inbox

### Implemented
- Human Inbox scoping per user
  - [crm-deployment/crm/www/human_inbox.py](mdc:crm-deployment/crm/www/human_inbox.py): filters by current user (sender/recipients) and restricts by user-owned `Email Account` when available.
- Email Account provisioning API
  - [crm-deployment/crm/api/settings.py](mdc:crm-deployment/crm/api/settings.py): `create_email_account` with provider presets (Gmail/Outlook/etc.), incoming/outgoing, initial sync.
- Communication auto-linking hook
  - [crm-deployment/crm/hooks.py](mdc:crm-deployment/crm/hooks.py): `after_insert` → `crm.api.email.auto_link_communication`.
  - [crm-deployment/crm/api/email.py](mdc:crm-deployment/crm/api/email.py): resolver to link by thread → Contact → Deal (optional) → Lead → Org domain.

### Missing / Next
- SPA “Connect Email” modal on `/crm/human_inbox` calling `crm.api.settings.create_email_account`.
- OAuth option for Gmail/Outlook (optional next sprint); App Password works now.
- Ensure “If Owner” perms on `Email Account` in Role Permission Manager.

### Risks
- Shared/global Email Account would bypass isolation; ensure ownership = creator and UI only lists user-owned senders.

## 2) Farfalle Intelligence

### Implemented
- `/crm/ai` page calls Farfalle intel
  - AiCopilot SPA page wired (local usage) to `POST /intel/enrich_lead` and saves summary to `FCRM Note`.
- Farfalle backend intel endpoint
  - `POST /intel/enrich_lead`: summarization + key insights.

### Missing / Next
- Production URL config + error handling, caching, retries, observability.
- Intent router/streaming for long queries.

### Risks
- Provider timeouts/cost; add timeouts, retries, caching.

## 3) Voice (Vapi/Twilio)

### Implemented
- Playbook/rules documented.

### Missing / Next
- CRM endpoints: `initiate_outbound_call()` and `vapi_webhook()` in `crm/integrations/twilio/api.py`.
- Farfalle thin wrappers to call CRM endpoints.
- SPA Voice Dashboard consumes CRM Call Logs.

### Risks
- PII in logs; ensure redaction and limited retention.

## 4) LeadGen Pipeline

### Implemented
- DocTypes and collectors scaffolded; architecture plan in `leadGen.mdc` expanded.

### Missing / Next
- Reconcile leadgen job orchestration with existing `crm/api/etl.py` (single job framework).
- Scoring, tiering, outreach sequences wired end-to-end.

### Risks
- API rate limits; add batching, backoff, caching.

## 5) RBAC & Permissions

### Implemented
- Owner scoping on `CRM Lead` list for non-managers
  - [crm-deployment/crm/api/doc.py](mdc:crm-deployment/crm/api/doc.py): default `owner = session user`.
- Human Inbox isolation (see §1).

### Missing / Next
- Confirm Role Permission Manager settings (If Owner) for `CRM Lead`, `Lead Prospect`, `Email Account`, and Communications list views.

## 6) Deployment

### Implemented
- Repo structured for Frappe Cloud (root packaging files, app under `crm/`).
- History scrubbed for secrets.

### Missing / Next
- Add gitleaks pre-commit and CI; rotate any previously exposed keys; update env on Cloud.
- Farfalle deployment/staging URL and config.

## 7) 7‑Day Action Plan

Day 1–2
- Add “Connect Email” modal to Human Inbox SPA → call `crm.api.settings.create_email_account` (Gmail App Password first).
- Enforce If Owner on `Email Account`; verify UI lists only user-owned senders.

Day 3–4
- Farfalle: add retries, timeouts, basic caching; configurable base URL in SPA/Server.
- Intent router/stream placeholder (server logs + progressive rendering on SPA).

Day 5–6
- Voice: implement `initiate_outbound_call`, `vapi_webhook`; create minimal Call Log on inbound webhooks; SPA status feed.

Day 7
- LeadGen: unify job orchestration with `crm/api/etl.py`; wire scoring/tiering to promotion.

## 8) Acceptance Criteria
- Human Inbox: per-user isolation verified (User B does not see User A mail).
- Email onboarding: self-serve modal creates user-owned Email Account; outbound uses that account.
- Farfalle: `/crm/ai` stable against timeouts; saves notes; basic caching in place.
- Voice: sandbox call results in CRM Call Log + Note; SPA shows status.
- LeadGen: one end-to-end run from collect → score → promote → sequence draft.

